# Koe's version — the only place it's set. build.sh writes it into Info.plist (both the development build and
# the release); the DMG name (Koe-<VERSION>.dmg) and the update feed (appcast.sh) take it from the app.
#   VERSION — what people see: About, the DMG name, the update window.
#   BUILD   — a whole number, one more with every release. Sparkle compares it to tell which version is newer.
# For a test build with another version: KOE_VERSION=0.9.1 KOE_BUILD=2 ./menubar/build.sh release
VERSION=1.0.1
BUILD=3
